# fleet-health-ingest

Generic host-health ingest lab: FastAPI POST, MariaDB, Grafana. Compose locally. Actions to GHCR. Terraform on AWS next.

At session start, read `AGENTS.md`, `STATUS.md`, `NAMING.md`, and `GLOSSARY.md`. Do the next STATUS item. Do not invent scope. Do not invent name tokens.

This lab is for learning. Teach AWS from Linux/ops analogues (see the continue-session skill). Do not assume prior AWS.

- Public repo: no personal details, employer names, internal product names, customer data, or cloud keys.
- Runtime is LXC. Do not install Docker, Terraform, or AWS CLIs on the host.
- Lab Compose passwords stay in Compose. Do not reuse them on AWS.
- Use a regular hyphen `-`. Do not use em dashes.
- End of session: update `STATUS.md`.
